{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415668","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415668","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1041566801:1":{"text":"妈妈，奇奇说想出去玩，我能一起去吗？","source_cn":"妈妈，奇奇说想出去玩，我能一起去吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFC686DEA39BF93AB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041566802:1":{"text":"外面很危险……好吧，你可以出去玩。","source_cn":"外面很危险……好吧，你可以出去玩。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x11F4CB0A6A21D669","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041566803:1":{"text":"但你得先穿上外套。","source_cn":"但你得先穿上外套。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8580A786418499F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041566804:1":{"text":"妈妈给你缝了一件厚些的，你说过，上次的绣花有些花哨，所以这次是纯色。","source_cn":"妈妈给你缝了一件厚些的，你说过，上次的绣花有些花哨，所...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF7C50DB19271959","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041566805:1":{"text":"袖子好像做长了一些，你先看看合不合身，样子喜不喜欢。","source_cn":"袖子好像做长了一些，你先看看合不合身，样子喜不喜欢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x04F1A4CCC3D9B47C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7